/a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3935168&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608817281" alt="Lyrics Linn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3935168)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lyrics-linn" >Lyrics Linn</a></span></li> <li><em>每说一声再见，就是死去一点。——《漫长的告别》</em></li> </ul> <p>17. <strong>北欧神话</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1143">SCP-CN-1143</a></strong> - 北欧的终结 by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3396110&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608817281" alt="Kcorena" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3396110)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" >Kcorena</a></span></li> <li><em>“只要那孩子还立在大地上，他就是不败的”</em></li> </ul> <p>18. <strong>赛博朋克</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/neur0mancer">亚伯拉罕末班车</a></strong> by (account deleted)</li> <li>“<em>你真他妈是一疯狗，畜生。”第十三个妓女尸体躺在地上，话还未说完就跟着腹部流出来肠子昏歇。</em>”</li> </ul> <p>19. <strong>演化</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1868">SCP-CN-1868</a></strong> - 自知之明 by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-zhengshi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5288378&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608817281" alt="Dr Zhengshi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5288378)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-zhengshi" >Dr Zhengshi</a></span></li> <li><em>演化之路永无止境，我们同样不曾奢望自己已经无需超越自己，便能行至尽头。</em></li> </ul> <p>20. <strong>武术</strong></p> <ul> <li><strong><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/sharkypedia-eoyemlau">游音流 - 鲨击百科</a></strong> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4055881&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608817281" alt="Etinjat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4055881)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" >Etinjat</a></span></li> <li><em>只要在我的音击里，妳的命运最终都会落到我这拳头上。 ——游音流大师丝嘉丽，于1941年殴打古鲨．古拉时</em></li> </ul> </div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div> </div> </div> <br /></div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-17" style="display:none"> <p>1546：</p> <blockquote> <p>你但凡加个附录我都不会-</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>欣赏不来。</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>连源代码都翻了依然不明觉厉</p> </blockquote> <p>1374：</p> <blockquote> <p>推的太多了，d了</p> </blockquote> <p>400：</p> <blockquote> <p>没有亮点，令读者读不下去，节奏稀烂，用大段附录在scp里写故事这种形式过于不行，没有必要</p> </blockquote> <p>1184：</p> <blockquote> <p>节奏稀烂，从一个跳到另一个实在是莫名其妙。上一秒基金会还打算隐瞒信息让云民和虫子相互制衡，下一秒云民就决定和虫子集体自灭，完全没有道理。给人的观感一言难尽。</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>同上，作者应该是难以掌握长篇节奏。</p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3396110&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608817281" alt="Kcorena" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3396110)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena" >Kcorena</a></span></p> 
